18's low 2578.33, so the newest H1 close is bearish and under the prior bar's low; the H4 context's last close 2586.68 predates these two H1 closes.", "H4 context flags a buy climax: bar 116's 2700.00 exceeded 2680.00 by only 20.00 and closed 61.51 below its high, and its final bar closed under the 7-bar range low 2604.75 and under the lows of bars 113-119; this long is the first pullback of a possibly unconfirmed MTR, with 2537.57-2544.63 as deeper support.", "The entry is not the range's extreme low (2569.8) and no bull breakout above 2594.57 has occurred, so the stop can be filled while the 12-bar range is still undecided."], "qualitative_confidence": "low", "uncertainty": ["The 12-bar M15 range 2569.8-2594.57 has not resolved; a break below 2569.8 (bear flag) and a break above 2594.57 (bull flag) are both live.", "The buy stop at 2577.99 is pending and untriggered at the 2577.06 close; if price closes below 2569.8 first the setup is void.", "The H4 context's content ends at the H1 bar 117 close 2586.68 (as-of 1789876799999) and excludes H1 bars 118-119 (closes 2580.35, 2577.06), so its bullish 'final close above 2585.50' point is older than the raw bars.", "The 2700.00 buy climax with a 61.51 upper tail raises the chance the pullback extends toward 2537.57-2544.63 before any resumption, which would invalidate this entry even if the larger trend stays up."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 close below 2569.8 (bar 109 low) breaks the pullback's double bottom and voids the long; next references are the H4 pre-breakout top 2544.63/2537.57 and then 2495.82.", "Acceptance above 2594.57 (bars 108/109 high) confirms the range as a bull flag and puts 2604.75 and 2643.52 in play.", "Two consecutive M15 closes below 2569.8 would confirm the bear flag and shift the read toward the H4 range breakdown described in the H4 transition conditions.", "If price makes a lower high under 2577.99 and closes below 2573.82 (bar 118 low) without triggering, the bull signal