o a bull-flag launch."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the 16-bar M15 range resolves as a bear flag (continuation of H4 bar 120's break below 2604.75) or as a bull flag inside the H4 channel is unresolved at the decision bar.", "Whether H4's 2700.00 marginal new high (20.00 above 2680.00) is an unconfirmed lower high / MTR or a pause before another bull leg.", "Whether the 2569.80 shelf holds or breaks: bar 119's low 2570.00 leaves the level intact by only 0.20, so the test is unresolved rather than failed."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 close below 2569.80 (M15 bar 105 low) with follow-through would confirm the bear-flag breakdown and make a stop short with invalidation above 2583.54 (M15 bar 117 high) actionable.", "An M15 close above 2594.57 (M15 bars 104-105 equal high) with follow-through would confirm an upward resolution of the range and re-align the M15 with the H4/D1 bull trend.", "A bull reversal bar closing back above 2583.54 with a higher low would keep the H4 bull channel read and convert the shelf into a launch point.", "An H4 close below 2495.82 (H4 bar 111 low) would end the higher-low sequence and confirm the reversal case, shifting the read away from bull-trend."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, open_time 1779494400000 to 1789776000000, with the decision at the close of the final bar (close_time 1789862399999).", "Window high is 2771 (bar 90, open_time 1787270400000); window low is 1368.42 (bar 14, open_time 1780704000000).", "Bars 10-14 (1780358400000-1780704000000) are five overlapping bear bars driving 2006.17 down to 1368.42; bar 14 closes 1568.55, about 200 points above its low, a sell-climax tail.", "Bar 88 (1787097600000) opens 1916.51 inside the prior consolidation and closes 2252.16 near its 2293.8 high; bars 89-90 close 2