op above 2645.88 with invalidation at 2622.06 would be structurally defensible and has not been invalidated by any supplied bar.", "H4 context records 22 bars of higher highs (2450.87 to 2700.00) and higher pullback lows (2370.54, 2436.87, 2495.82) from the 2358.62 low, and the last H4 bar (1789905600000) closed at its own high 2611.00, so the bull leg is intact and 2568.16 was not broken."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the H4/D1 range-top supply or the H1/H4 bull leg dominates the next several bars; the context labels are fallible descriptions and the raw H1 breakout with follow-through is real, so a stop above 2645.88 could still resolve into a range-top test.", "The M15 pullback has produced no signal bar yet, so the same overlapping bars could resolve up (flag breakout) or down (failed flag) within the next bar; pending-versus-failed cannot be settled from supplied bars.", "H4 'phase: range' and 'primary_regime: trading-range' conflict with the D1 'primary_regime: bull-trend' label; neither is treated as a vote."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 bull bar closing on its high through 2632.57, then a triggered stop above 2645.88 holding above it, would make the bull-flag breakout actionable with invalidation at 2622.06.", "Two consecutive closes above 2645.88, and then acceptance above 2700.00, would shift the read from range rotation to bull breakout per the H4 transition conditions.", "A close below 2622.06 and then below 2605.96 (M15 bar 108 low) would break the double bottom and the spike low, re-opening rotation toward 2495.82 and the H4 floor 2436.87/2358.62.", "A close below 2568.16 (H4 pullback low) would negate the H1 bull leg and shift the structural read bearish."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, open_time 1779494400000 to 1789776000000, 