pper tail); a stronger bull bar closing on its high would raise confidence in the same trigger.", "The D1 context is 15 hours older than the frozen decision time and its 2771/2557 levels are contextual descriptions; the D1 spike high 2771 was exceeded only by a wick (M15 bar 98 high 2850) with no close above it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A M15 close back below 2731.83 (bar 119 low) and then below 2718.09 (bar 117 low) would mark a failed breakout of the range high and void the long case.", "A M15/H1 close below 2702.56 (bar 98 low) would break the three-hour acceptance above the H4 2700 zone and return price to the prior H4 wide range.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2718.09 and 2747.76 without exceeding 2747.76 would keep the tight-range read and argue against a breakout.", "A M15 close above 2747.76 with the low holding above 2731.83 would confirm the breakout and shift the focus to 2771 and then 2850."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790027999999, "market_context": {"regime": "bull trend on H1/H4/D1; M15 bull leg pausing in a two-sided pullback that still holds above the last breakout shelf", "h4": "context freshness current: bull-trend / breakout-spike above the 2700.00 equal highs (bars 106/116) with spike high 2850.00 on bar 118 (upper tail 126.85 = 66% of its 191.94 range) and contracting bars 119-120 (76.91, 35.81) that stop below 2850.00; possible buy-climax shape, no bear reversal bar printed yet", "h1": "bull trend with rising lows 2646.02 -> 2658.06 -> 2694.94 -> 2709.56 -> 2718.09 -> 2737.86 -> 2762.93; last H1 bar (open_time_ms 1790024400000) is a bear bar open 2781.77, high 2782.00, low 2762.93, close 2768.10 after the bull bar open 2760.51, high 2804.59, close 2781.77", "m15": "bull leg 2734.22 (bar 103 low) to 2804.59 (bar 113 high); six-bar pullback to 2762.93 (bar 117 low) holding above the 2746.20-2756.72 shelf (bar 111 low 2746.20, bar 111 high 2756.72, bar 107 close 2756.61); last bar 119 open 2776.18, high 2776.18, low 2768.10, close 2768.10", "levels": {"resistance": ["2804.59", "2850.00"], "support": ["2762.93", "2746.20", "2734.22", "2718.09"]}}, "setup": {"type": "bull-trend pullback continuation: buy stop above M15 bull signal bar 118 high", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H4", "H1", "M15"], "entry_mechanism": "continuation", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 118 (bull signal bar, close in top quarter of range) high", "price_field": "high", "price": "2779.05", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 118, "open_time_ms": 1790026200000, "close_time_ms": 1790027099999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low (pullback low / breakout-test low)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2762.93", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1790025300000, "close_time_ms": 1790026199999}}, "evidence_for": ["Higher-timeframe trend agrees with the long: H4 context (freshness current) is bull-trend/breakout-spike with bars 113-120 closing 2577.69 to 2760.51 (seven of eight closes higher) and the 2700.00 equal highs of H4 bars 106/116 exceeded (closes 2723.15, 2754.31, 2760.51).", "M15 sequence of higher lows is intact: 2718.09 (bar 89 low), 2730.01 (bar 95 low), 2734.22 (bar 103 low), 2762.93 (bar 117 low), so the current pullback has not broken the bull leg structure.", "The six-bar M15 pullback off 2804.59 (bar 113 high) is holding above the prior breakout shelf 2746.20-2756.72 (bar 111 low 2746.20, high 2756.72; bar 107 close 2756.61), i.e. a breakout test rather than a broken trend.", "M15 bar 118 is a bull reversal bar (open 2768.60, low 2768.42, high 2779.05, close 2776.18) closing in the top quarter of its range and above bar 117's high 2769.23, giving a specific pendin