": ["A close above 2785.48 (M15 1790031600000 high) with a hold above 2762.69 would resolve the tight range up and make the bull-flag continuation actionable.", "A close below 2759.63 (M15 1790020800000 low) followed by a close below 2734.22 (M15 1790012700000 low) would confirm the downside breakout and shift the M15 read to a lower-high reversal inside the H4 range.", "A close above 2804.59 (M15 1790021700000 high) that holds would mark acceptance above the spike high and weaken the climax reading; a close back below 2713.04/2718.09 would indicate the 2804.59 spike failed.", "H4 resolution: a close below 2658.06 (H4 1789977600000 low) would mark the H4 spike as failed and materially change the bull-trend read."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790035199999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["The window opens at 2109.85 (close of 1779667200000) after a 2139.34 high, then declines 13 bars to 1368.42 (low of 1780704000000), about 36% below 2139.34.", "Bar 1780704000000 has a 230.85 range with a 200.13 lower tail and closes at 1568.55 (top ~13% of its range); bar 1780790400000 (open 1568.55, high 1690.78, low 1563.52, close 1687.83) is a bull reversal bar closing at its high.", "From 1780790400000 to 1787011200000 (73 bars) price overlaps repeatedly between 1512.91 (low of 1782432000000) and 1974.46 (high of 1785110400000); closes cluster 1550-1950 with many overlapping bodies and mixed closes (two-sided range).", "Bar 1787097600000 breaks out: open 1916.51, high 2293.80, low 1905.63, close 2252.16, a 388.17-point bull trend bar closing in the top ~11% of its range and above the 1974.46 range top.", "Bar 1787270400000 spikes to 2771 with a 445.69 range, closing 2515.30 and leaving a ~255.70 upper tail.", "Bars 1787184000000 through 1789603200000 (27 bars) stay between 2357.18 (low of 1788307200000) and 2680 (high of 1789084800000); bodies overlap and closes sit mostly